# EXACT bytes — LF-only, embedded quoted newlines, leading blank lines, a UTF-8
# BOM — to pin the byte-offset oracle and line-contract snapshots. They must
# NOT be EOL-converted, so this OVERRIDES the repo-root `*.ags text eol=crlf`
# for this directory only (the closest .gitattributes wins).
*.ags -text
